From 6b4b48f8f9aabae887d551b19074ab1977744d70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nova <361320585+q2-nova@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 03:29:15 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] MIPS: dts: add X2000 and Shanling Q2 boot configuration

Describe the boot-critical clocks, CCU, INTC, timers, GPIOs and UARTs.
The SoC tree draws on the Ingenic-community X2000 tree; Q2 memory and
console wiring follow the stock firmware. Enable SMP and an initramfs
console as the first bring-up milestone. Peripheral drivers and binding
schemas are subsequent development work; this is not a release kernel.
---
 arch/mips/boot/dts/ingenic/Makefile        |   1 +
 arch/mips/boot/dts/ingenic/shanling-q2.dts |  37 ++++
 arch/mips/boot/dts/ingenic/x2000.dtsi      | 195 +++++++++++++++++++++
 arch/mips/configs/shanling_q2_defconfig    |  43 +++++
 4 files changed, 276 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/mips/boot/dts/ingenic/shanling-q2.dts
 create mode 100644 arch/mips/boot/dts/ingenic/x2000.dtsi
 create mode 100644 arch/mips/configs/shanling_q2_defconfig

